{
  "metadata": {
    "gameTitle": "Dungeon Crawl",
    "sourceNotes": [
      "Rules.docx describes a cooperative 4-player tabletop dungeon crawler with a 6-room run ending in a boss.",
      "Players.xlsx supplied the character roster and raw ability text.",
      "Encounters.xlsx supplied combat and special room content.",
      "Cards.xlsx appears to contain a different card-game template with Villians/Events/Properties and is not used in this MVP seed."
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "MVP is local single-device hot-seat/solo party control, not online multiplayer.",
      "Room 1-4 are treated as A-tier rooms and Room 5-8 as B-tier rooms until explicit A/B labels are added.",
      "Combat-room loot rewards were not extractable from the sheets, so all non-boss combat rooms use placeholder lootReward=2.",
      "The full 32-card Dungeon Crawl loot deck was not present in the uploaded sheets; starter loot below is placeholder content for MVP testing.",
      "Ability text is kept as rawText and paired with structured effects where obvious. Ambiguous effects are marked with implementationNotes."
    ]
  },
